308-11ec-b99e-fbe4f8eda4e7/file-1kzwlvstz.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Force of viscosity can be written as follows:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.108ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.722ex\" height=\"3.11ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -884.7 4297.1 1374.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(827.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1883.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D702\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D702\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2386.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(3136.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(223.9,394) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D466\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D466\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"920.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Here <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.489ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.138ex\" height=\"1.489ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 503 658\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D702\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D702\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is coefficient of viscosity, A is face area of plate and dv / dy is velocity gradient. We can assume that velocity of fluid at the bottom (h depth below) is zero; hence <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.108ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.252ex\" height=\"3.11ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -884.7 3647.3 1374.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(223.9,394) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D466\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D466\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"920.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1438.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2494.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,457.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(372.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"210E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-210E\"></use></g><rect width=\"913.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>; hence force of viscocity can be written as follows:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.705ex\" height=\"2.539ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -769.6 4289.7 1122.4\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(827.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1883.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D702\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D702\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2386.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(3136.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,457.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(372.9,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"210E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-210E\"></use></g><rect width=\"913.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We can see that force of viscosity is inversely proportional to h; hence option (a) is correct.</p>\n<p>We can see that force of viscosity is proportional to area of plate; hence option (b) is wrong.</p>\n<p>Tangential stress can be written as <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.959ex\" height=\"3.023ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -983.5 3960 1336.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(290.7,485) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,-346.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><rect width=\"730.3\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1248.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2303.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D702\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D702\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2806.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,457.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g 